      468.99
    ],
    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me under Section 22 of the Industrial Disputes Act, No. 43 of 1950, Chapter 131, Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (Revised Edition 1956) as amended by the Industrial Disputes (Amendments) Act, Nos.14 and 62 of 1957 and 4 of 1962 [read with Industrial Disputes (Special Provisions) Act, No. 39 of 1968] I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do hereby",
